OL,3,ADrag Race co-creator warns of TV
OL,4,Arepresentation 'crisis' after BBC drops
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe executive producer of Drag Race has
OL,8,Fsaid there is a "crisis of
OL,9,Frepresentation" on TV, following the
OL,10,FBBC's decision to axe the UK edition of
OL,11,Fthe show.
OL,13,FSpeaking exclusively to BBC News,
OL,14,FFenton Bailey said he did not believe
OL,15,Fthere was a "hidden agenda" behind the
OL,16,Fdecision, but feared "vulnerable
OL,17,Fcommunities are going to be even more
OL,18,Fvulnerable".
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
